WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
Emily, it's out of control.

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.240
Yeah, I want to respond to what you were saying, Douglas,

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.360
which is so important.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.040
And I think as we all talk about the horror that we feel

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.760
over the safety of these officers,

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.040
I want to illustrate a couple legal angles too,

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.280
because it's also about equal protection.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.799
And this to me is creating sort of a giant legal mess

00:00:19.799 --> 00:00:21.799
that renders us even more vulnerable.

00:00:21.799 --> 00:00:24.920
And unlike JB Pritzker, I use words us,

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.480
because we are all Americans, right?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.900
And we are all under the same flag.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.780
And he continues using those pejoratives, and they,

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.900
and they, well, they are Americans tasked

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.860
with enforcing the laws that the legislature has passed.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.900
So it's not just about officer safety.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.459
It's about equal protection.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:45.459
And thank God nothing happened to a federal officer

00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:47.779
or a local officer, because I know for a fact

00:00:47.779 --> 00:00:52.380
that if they had indeed been ordered to stand down,

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.099
that all of them felt with their souls

00:00:55.099 --> 00:00:57.220
that it was crushing them to not render aid

00:00:57.259 --> 00:00:59.939
and come to the aid of their fellow Americans

00:00:59.939 --> 00:01:01.939
and their fellow brave Americans in uniform.

00:01:01.939 --> 00:01:03.580
And if something had happened, they have a massive case.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.220
This is deliberate indifference.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.540
This is breach of duty.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.940
And then we're sort of hearing, oh, no, no, no.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.019
We didn't order that.

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:11.139
So then that to me becomes a PR nightmare.

00:01:11.139 --> 00:01:13.260
And any criminal defense attorney will tell you

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.400
that that's creating this climate where then you can argue,

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.660
well, is there a bias?

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.660
Is there, again, that deliberate indifference?

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.940
Is there compromised investigation?

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:22.519
Has this been politicized?

00:01:22.519 --> 00:01:24.660
So anything coming anywhere remotely

00:01:24.699 --> 00:01:28.540
out of that jurisdiction I think is ripe for vulnerability.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:29.660
It's not just about this case.

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:31.739
It's not just about this aggressive

00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:33.220
and violent demonstration.

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:35.820
No, this is about the consequences

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.620
of having such a fractured identity,

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:42.059
not a unified front, and not realizing the force

00:01:42.059 --> 00:01:44.180
for the trees, the decisions and consequences.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:47.139
Go beyond a soundbite or click on your Instagram.

00:01:47.139 --> 00:01:50.500
It actually has real world legal consequences.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.160
And by God, if those consequences are physical,

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.199
then it's something that America cannot sustain.

00:01:55.199 --> 00:01:57.279
Look, last quick thought from you, Douglas,

00:01:57.279 --> 00:01:59.959
on technically creating a no zone inside

00:01:59.959 --> 00:02:02.440
of a sovereign nation against law enforcement.

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:03.599
Yeah, it's outrageous.

00:02:03.599 --> 00:02:04.720
And it's been going on for years.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.879
And it should have stopped years ago.

00:02:06.879 --> 00:02:09.720
You cannot have effectively militia,

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:11.800
which is what these groups like Antifa are.

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:14.080
They are militia on American streets.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.399
And every time Democratic lawmakers

00:02:16.399 --> 00:02:18.639
have been told about this, they say the same thing.

00:02:18.639 --> 00:02:21.119
They say things like either it's not happening

00:02:21.119 --> 00:02:23.720
or what we see with our own eyes isn't being seen,

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.839
isn't real, or they say things like,

00:02:25.839 --> 00:02:27.839
well, anti-fascist sounds good.

00:02:27.839 --> 00:02:28.960
Who isn't anti-fascist?

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.800
You go, this group is a fascist group.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.759
They literally dress in black block.

00:02:33.759 --> 00:02:36.199
They attack and hospitalized journalists.

00:02:36.199 --> 00:02:38.940
They will go out of their way to attack federal officers,

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.520
police, ICE, and others.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:43.279
And we just saw the other day with the shooter

00:02:43.279 --> 00:02:48.000
in California who fired his rifle at ICE agents.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.759
He killed two detainees.

00:02:50.759 --> 00:02:53.559
But he was firing live rounds at ICE officers.

00:02:53.559 --> 00:02:58.600
This is going to get worse if this is not finally countered.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.759
All right, we'll move forward.

00:02:59.759 --> 00:03:03.639
The would-be assassin of Justice Brett Kavanaugh

00:03:03.639 --> 00:03:06.119
has been sentenced to just eight years and one month

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:07.279
behind bars.

00:03:07.279 --> 00:03:09.679
And the Justice Department says that is not enough

00:03:09.679 --> 00:03:11.119
and now is ready to take action.

00:03:11.119 --> 00:03:11.919
We'll get into it.

00:03:11.919 --> 00:03:12.960
Stay close.

